         {
          "id": "60eb742",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "text-editor",
          "settings": {
           "editor": "<p>Pressure-sensitive adhesives are used across biotech, microfluidics, medical devices, electronics and aerospace. Goodfellow Microfabrication has developed a broad range of technologies to process them, for complex and simple parts on a prototyping or production basis.</p><p>Customers use these materials in applications such as microfluidics and medical devices, to bond layers together. Our laser technology covers cutting, patterning, layering and more.</p>",
